  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "K-001",
      "statement": "DeepSeek Harness 位于模型与工具、权限、Session、持久化和用户界面之间，是控制执行与状态的 Harness 层。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-003"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-002",
      "statement": "Agent loop 经过上下文投影、策略钩子、模型请求、Tool 选择与 executionMode 分类、带 exclusive barrier 的执行、按模型顺序提交 Tool 结果，以及继续或停止决策。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-003",
        "SRC-005"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-003",
      "statement": "Cordis 使用 Context、Service、Event、Effect 和 Scope 作为插件化运行时的核心原语。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-002"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-004",
      "statement": "Cordis 的可逆注册使服务、监听器和挂载能够随 Scope 清理，但不会自动撤销已发生的外部副作用。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-002"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-005",
      "statement": "Everything is a Plugin 表示 Host、Agent Preset、Model、Tool、Sandbox、Session、UI 和 policy 通过同一装配与生命周期语义组合。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-002",
        "SRC-003"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-006",
      "statement": "Agent Preset 每进程挂载一次形成 standing scope；每个 Session 的 Agent scope 通过 parent 关系加入所选 Preset，并通过 agent-preset/selected 事件记录切换。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-021"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-007",
      "statement": "Profile 的有效配置按 bundles、profile patch、home patch、CLI --patch 的顺序叠加。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-004"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-008",
      "statement": "Session event stream 是事实来源；projection cache 保存包含 key、ver、seq、val 的 versioned unit state checkpoint，再与事件尾部重放生成当前视图。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-003",
        "SRC-006"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-009",
      "statement": "model-visible means logged：会影响模型下一步判断的输入和结果必须进入 Session 事件。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-003",
        "SRC-006"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-010",
      "statement": "完整 capability seam 包含 Definition、Provider 和 Consumer；Provider 既可能单选，也可能像 Subagent 一样允许多个命名实现共存。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-003"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-011",
      "statement": "CLI、Web、headless、ACP 和 SDK 复用 Agent、Session 和 Tool 核心，而不是各自实现独立 Agent。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-004"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-012",
      "statement": "Web 通过 HTTP POST 上行，并以 events.mux 与 events.host 两条 downlink-only WebSocket 接收事件；TypeScript 与 Python SDK 都控制 out-of-process runtime，但 runtime ownership 不同。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-022"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-013",
      "statement": "Typert 在 Host build 中从 TypeScript 提取 Remote、reflection 和 Zod contract，再由 Client 编译面消费。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-004",
        "SRC-007"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-014",
      "statement": "动态 Cordis Plugin 使用不可变 Package、独立 Run、显式 approval、update、diagnostics 和 rollback；Client half 需要页面连接，且 Run ok 后仍可能出现后续 render failure。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-008",
        "SRC-002"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-015",
      "statement": "Host/Client 动态插件通过 package-private handle/call 交换 lossless JSON，不应跨边界传递 Context、Service 或 live snapshot。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-008"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-016",
      "statement": "评估私有部署时应区分本地运行、模型与数据路径本地化、企业控制面三层。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-009",
        "SRC-010"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-017",
      "statement": "Sandbox 合同只覆盖 file effects 与 same-world confinement；Windows ACL 不限制 reads、network 或 process visibility，同 UID Tool 仍可读取本地 managed credential，OTel 开启后可能导出广泛内容。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-009",
        "SRC-010"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-018",
      "statement": "当前公开来源未建立 SSO/RBAC、租户隔离、集中网络与密钥治理、防篡改审计、LTS/SLA 和支持合同等企业证据；这是证据缺口，不是绝对不存在的断言。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-010"
      ],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "kind": "inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-019",
      "statement": "Agent 市场需要区分 runtime/harness、developer product 和 enterprise platform 三个竞争层。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-001",
        "SRC-012",
        "SRC-013",
        "SRC-015",
        "SRC-016",
        "SRC-017",
        "SRC-018"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-020",
      "statement": "截至 2026-08-18 的公开快照中，DeepSeek Harness 有 157,324 stars 和 16,338 forks；这些指标只反映公开关注和实验兴趣。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-011"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-021",
      "statement": "AgentScope 是中国 runtime 层的近邻，快照为 29,019 stars 和 3,369 forks，并公开强调多模型、多租户/Session 服务部署、HITL、Tool review 与 sandbox。",
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC-012"
      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "fact"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-022",
      "statement": "Qwen Code 通过 CLI、headless、IDE、desktop、daemon、SDK 和中国协作入口形成开发者产品分发优势。",
      "source_refs": [
