    },
    {
      "id": "K-026",
      "statement": "LangGraph、OpenAI Agents SDK、Google ADK 和 Microsoft Agent Framework 在全球 runtime/framework 层争夺状态编排、评估、集成与厂商生态。",
      "source_refs": [
