      ],
      "confidence": "high",
      "kind": "inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "K-028",
      "statement": "可验证对比应冻结 grader/evaluator、任务、仓库版本、模型、工具、网络、预算和成功判据；patch 改变时使用新的 run_id，并保存 summary、report.json、test_output.txt、run_instance.log、eval.sh 与 patch.diff。",
